<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ mandated to arrange A$500 mln facility for BIL.</title>
<headline>ANZ mandated to arrange A$500 mln facility for BIL.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Investment Bank said on Thursday it had been mandated to arrange a A$500 million medium-term note programme for BIL Australia Finance Ltd, a unit of Brierley Investments Ltd.  </p>
<p>The programme will be launched in March 1997 with an initial issue of A$200 million.</p>
<p>ANZ Investment said the mandate was a significant step in the expansion of the corporate bond market in Australia.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
